    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Man vs The Red Button</h2>You are in front of a red button you must no press.<br>Will you dare to defy the unknown, or will you walk away, forever wondering what could have been?<br>Only the strongest will be rewarded and enter the Empty Place.<br><br>This game includes:<br>- A button<br>- A choice<br>- A secret place<br>- 10 ranks to climb. <br>- 80.6mb of data<br>- You don't need a mouse, a keyboard or even a screen to play it.<br>- Voice acting by Shakyra Dunn.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828820/extras/3a26fe35c6c3420a4672272780f8cc14.poster.avif?t=1728315964\" width=484 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828820/extras/3a26fe35c6c3420a4672272780f8cc14.webm?t=1728315964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828820/extras/3a26fe35c6c3420a4672272780f8cc14.mp4?t=1728315964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
